# QA finding E7: the integrity lockfile hashes working-tree bytes. A clone with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrote every locked text file with CRLF and drifted all
# governance paths at once, indistinguishable from tampering. Pin LF so the
# digest is a property of the content, not of the checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
